+# Integrated poll observer
+
+The ten existing1557 cases now reference the actual production runtime service. No service source is compiled into the observer. The five service type suffixes are removed and the existing finite before-native-poll observation is supplied through the internal production constructor. No native reply, cancellation or lifetime certificate is synthesized. The old1554 lost-wake failure and both earlier CI runs remain retained. These cases and the seven actual logical-VM cases are focused integration controls, not original OTP equality or complete fd transfer acceptance.
